cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "rocq-claude: verified Elias-Fano in Rocq (Proofs as Reviews)"
abstract: >-
  A verified implementation of Elias-Fano encoding, produced by an LLM agent
  (Claude via Claude Code) and mechanically checked by the Rocq proof assistant,
  demonstrating the "Proofs as Reviews" thesis: machines vibe-code and prove,
  humans review only the specification. Includes an OCaml/C extraction path and
  a Docker-based benchmark suite for evaluating LLM agents on verified code
  generation.
type: software
